@startuml

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Node A" as A
participant "Node B" as B

== Push phase ==
loop Periodic push dissemination
  A --> B: SENSOR_UPDATE(sensor_id, value, ts_ms, origin, seq)
  B -> B: merge update (LWW policy)
end

== Pull phase ==
loop Pull recovery (on sampled peers)
  A -> B: GET_DELTA(from_seq)
  loop For each available delta
    B --> A: SENSOR_UPDATE(sensor_id, value, ts_ms, origin, seq)
    A -> A: merge update (LWW policy)
  end
end

note over A,B
Push-pull synchronization path: opportunistic push plus cursor-based pull recovery.
end note

@enduml
